Lessons Learned

This lab provided hands-on experience with Linux account management, groups, file permissions, sudo privileges, and basic system hardening.

A key takeaway was that administrative access should be limited to authorized users rather than allowing every account to operate with elevated privileges.

Disclaimer

This project was performed in a controlled Ubuntu virtual machine for educational purposes.


